invalid type: string "Sachin Tendulkar is a former Indian cricketer and one of the most famous\n        batsmen in cricket history. He represented India for more than two decades. Tendulkar\n        scored 100 international centuries and became the first player to score a double century\n        in men's ODI cricket. He was part of India's 2011 World Cup winning team.", expected a boolean]ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ